	(text "Layout: J1/J11 -> Q1 -> +24V carries the 5.2 A cold motor stall (plan section 2, #63).\nVIN_RAW, +24V and the GND return from J1 pins 2/3 and J11 pin 2: pours, or traces at least\n3 mm wide on 1 oz outer copper (about 10 °C rise, IPC-2221, general knowledge).\nQ1 AOD409: put about 1 in² (645 mm²) of VIN_RAW copper on the drain tab (pad 2).\nR_DS(on) 40 mΩ max at 25 °C, 53 mΩ typ at 125 °C (D65 p2): 1.1-1.4 W at 5.2 A.\nR_θJA 40-50 °C/W is for 1 in² of 2 oz copper (D65 p1-2 note A); 1 oz runs hotter.\nD3 SMBJ24A: next to Q1 source / C21, close to the input, with a short wide GND return\nto the J1/J11 GND pins (general knowledge)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 50.8 91.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3050c580-9026-42af-8f2f-eb028b428565")
	)
